      <!--

    ************************ FeatureViewer ************************

    A Feature is its geometry drawn (through the editor's AdaptiveViewer, which dispatches by the
    geometry's runtime type - a Point gets the pin) with its attributes listed under it by the
    editor's own DictionaryViewer, in one Column - what a GIS shows when you click a feature.
-->
